    "title": "Where to watch Duke vs St. John's in March Madness Sweet 16: Time, TV Channel",
    "text": "Updated March 27, 2026, 10:42 p.m. ETMarch Madness is underway and college basketball's big dance continues with No. 1 seed Duke taking on No. 5 seed St. John's in a Sweet 16 matchup on Friday, March 27. Here's everything you need to know to tune in for the clash between the Red Storm and Blue Devils.USA TODAY Sports has a team of journalists covering men's March Madness to keep you up to date with every point scored, rebound grabbed and game won in the 68-team tournament.Watch Duke vs. St. John's free with FuboWhat time is St. John's vs Duke Sweet 16 game?No. 1 Duke vs No. 5 St. John's tips off at 7:10 PM (EST) on Friday, March 27 from Capital One Arena (Washington, District of Columbia).What channel is St. John's vs Duke Sweet 16 game?No. 1 Duke vs No. 5 St. John's is airing live on CBS (watch free with Fubo).How to stream St. John's vs Duke Sweet 16 gameNo. 1 Duke vs No. 5 St. John's is available to stream on Fubo.Watch Duke vs. St. John's free with FuboSt. John's March Madness resultsRound of 62: def No. 12 Northern Iowa, 79-53Round of 32: def No. 4 Kansas, 67-65Duke March Madness resultsRound of 62: def No. 16 Siena, 71-65Round of 32: def No. 9 TCU, 81-58Men's March Madness schedule todaySee the schedule, live scores and results for all of Friday's NCAA Tournament action here.Watch Duke vs. St. John's free with Fubo2026 March Madness datesMarch 17-18: First FourMarch 19-20: First RoundMarch 21-22: Second RoundMarch 26-27: Sweet 16March 28-29: Elite 8April 4: Final FourApril 6: National ChampionshipOur team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.Information in this article was imported automatically into a template written and reviewed by a USA TODAY Sports editor. You can send feedback using this form.",
